# A minion: one agent run with no issue and no PR (docs/events.md).
# Rename to wiki-refresh.yml to turn it on. `factory minion list` checks it.
name: wiki-refresh
description: When a task changes, say which wiki page is now out of date.
on:
  event: tasks.task.updated
prompt: |
  A task changed. Read the event data and decide which wiki page, if any, it
  makes out of date. Answer with one JSON object:
  {"page": "<path or null>", "summary": "<one sentence on what changed>"}.
emit: wiki.page.updated
budgetUsd: 0.5
